<!DOCTYPE html><!-- SYNTHETIC FIXTURE: copies the gjeldende-lover document shape; no Lovdata text. --><html lang="no"><head><title>Lov om prøving (prøveloven)</title><base href="https://lovdata.no/" /></head><body><header class="documentHeader" id="hode"><dl class="data-document-key-info"><dt class="legacyID">Datokode</dt><dd class="legacyID">LOV-2019-06-14-99</dd><dt class="dokid">DokumentID</dt><dd class="dokid">NL/lov/2019-06-14-99</dd><dt class="dateInForce">I kraft fra</dt><dd class="dateInForce">2021-01-01</dd><dt class="dateOfPublication">Kunngjort</dt><dd class="dateOfPublication">2019-06-14</dd><dt class="title">Tittel</dt><dd class="title">Lov om prøving (prøveloven)</dd><dt class="refid">RefID</dt><dd class="refid">lov/2019-06-14-99</dd></dl></header><main class="documentBody" data-lovdata-URL="NL/lov/2019-06-14-99" id="dokument"><h1>Lov om prøving (prøveloven)</h1><section class="section" data-name="kap1" id="kapittel-1"><h2>Kapittel 1. Innledning</h2><article class="legalArticle" data-name="§1" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-1"><h4 class="legalArticleHeader"><span class="legalArticleValue">§ 1</span>. <span class="legalArticleTitle">Virkeområde</span></h4><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-1-ledd-1">Loven gjelder prøving av statsforvalteren. Den gjelder også <a href="lov/2019-06-14-99/§2">retting</a>.</article><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-1-ledd-2">Annet ledd første punktum. Annet ledd nytt annet punktum.</article><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-1-ledd-3">Tredje ledd er nytt.</article><article class="changesToParent">Endret ved lov 18 des 2020 nr. 999.</article></article><article class="legalArticle" data-name="§2" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-2"><h4 class="legalArticleHeader"><span class="legalArticleValue">§ 2</span>. <span class="legalArticleTitle">Liste</span></h4><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-2-ledd-1">Følgende gjelder:<ol class="defaultList" type="a"><li data-name="a." value="1"><article class="listArticle" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-2-ledd-1-punkt-1"><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-2-ledd-1-punkt-1-ledd-1">bokstav a</article></article></li><li data-name="b." value="2"><article class="listArticle" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-2-ledd-1-punkt-2"><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-2-ledd-1-punkt-2-ledd-1">bokstav b</article></article></li></ol></article></article><article class="legalArticle" data-name="§2a" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-3"><h4 class="legalArticleHeader"><span class="legalArticleValue">§ 2 a</span>. <span class="legalArticleTitle">Innskutt</span></h4><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-1-paragraf-3-ledd-1">Innskutt første ledd.</article><article class="changesToParent">Tilføyd ved lov 18 des 2020 nr. 999 (ikr. 1 jan 2022 iflg. res. 28 mai 2021 nr. 9998).</article></article></section><section class="section" data-name="kap2" id="kapittel-2"><h2>Kapittel 2. Slutt</h2><article class="legalArticle" data-name="§3" id="kapittel-2-paragraf-1"><h4 class="legalArticleHeader"><span class="legalArticleValue">§ 3</span>. <span class="legalArticleTitle">Ikrafttredelse og overgang</span></h4><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-2-paragraf-1-ledd-1">Loven gjelder fra den tid<sup class="footnotereference">1</sup> Kongen bestemmer.</article><article class="legalP" id="kapittel-2-paragraf-1-ledd-2">Departementet kan gi overgangsregler.</article></article><article class="legalArticle" data-name="§4" id="kapittel-2-paragraf-2"><h4 class="legalArticleHeader"><span class="legalArticleValue">§ 4</span>. <span class="legalArticleTitle">(Opphevet)</span></h4><article class="changesToParent">Opphevet ved lov 18 des 2020 nr. 999.</article></article></section><footer class="footnotes"><span class="footnoteLabel">1</span> Fra 1 jan 2021 iflg. res. 28 feb 2020 nr. 9999.</footer></main></body></html>
